{
  "name": "dsh-opusmc-viewer",
  "version": "3.0.0",
  "description": "MC建筑工坊：先思考后建造的 Minecraft 建筑工作流 DSH 插件。写代码前必须先交设计书（八节含体量档位与 ≥8 行算式），否则 design=BLOCK 不生成；四道闸门（design / aesthetic / walkable / 一致性）不过一律内部返工。体量按档位自报（小 <10k、中型 10k~80k、大型 ≥100k，默认中型 20k~50k）。含 mc_* 在线施工工具、mc_build_code 蓝图生成、vendored 构建脚本（Arena/aesthetic_kit/checks/build_kit）、可通行与装饰承托与净空三项自检，以及右下角建筑上帝视角面板实时预览。自包含，clone 后无需额外配置即可使用。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "minecraft",
    "litematic",
    "litematica",
    "building",
    "architecture",
    "mc-architect"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Yiifan-Crypto",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Yiifan-Crypto/dsh-MC-Build",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Yiifan-Crypto/dsh-MC-Build.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Yiifan-Crypto/dsh-MC-Build/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "paths.mjs",
    "mctools.mjs",
    "mcbuild.mjs",
    "litematic.mjs",
    "render-shot.cjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "scripts",
    "skills",
    "references",
    "locale",
    "docs",
    "viewer",
    "NOTICE.md",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test tests/*.test.mjs",
    "test:watch": "node --test --watch tests/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.11.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.2-rc.1 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout"
      ]
    }
  }
}
